<title>FINLAND: TABLE - FINLAND BANK RESERVES UP FIM 669 MLN IN WEEK.</title>
<headline>TABLE - FINLAND BANK RESERVES UP FIM 669 MLN IN WEEK.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1997-08-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bank of Finland's latest balance sheet for the week to August 8 showed the following positions in millions of markka compared to July 31:</p>
<p> Position			   Latest     Previous</p>
<p> Foreign reserves		 65,144     64,475</p>
<p> Money market intervention    8,693	10,575</p>
<p> Govt sector claims	     1,921	1,921</p>
<p> Corporate sector claims	1,908	1,908</p>
<p> Other				8,211	7,995</p>
<p> Total assets		     85,877     86,874</p>
<p>In the previous week to July 31 reserves rose by 457 million markka.</p>
<p>-- Helsinki newsroom +358-9-680 50 245, news@reuters.fi</p>
